{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794302858063,"sessionID":"ses_e3b3de4c9ffekfjzaZP6rZ8fp0","part":{"id":"prt_1c4c8d3350010TxI99WarIaCiq","messageID":"msg_1c4c8c1bc001YClXg9qy6NrNml","sessionID":"ses_e3b3de4c9ffekfjzaZP6rZ8fp0","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794302858063,"sessionID":"ses_e3b3de4c9ffekfjzaZP6rZ8fp0","part":{"id":"prt_1c4c8d338001krMf5NgKo2SbKC","messageID":"msg_1c4c8c1bc001YClXg9qy6NrNml","sessionID":"ses_e3b3de4c9ffekfjzaZP6rZ8fp0","type":"text","text":"Done. The quiz app is complete.\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`): Flask + SQLite with bearer-token auth, all endpoints (`/api/auth/register`, `/api/auth/login`, `/api/quiz`, `/api/attempts`, `/api/attempts/{id}`, `/api/admin/questions`), 25 seeded questions, admin account driven by `ADMIN_PASSWORD`, and frontend static serving.\n\n**Frontend** (`frontend/`): React + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind CSS, with auth forms, one-question-at-a-time quiz with progress bar, result review view, saved-attempts list, and admin panel.\n\nKey behaviors verified end-to-end:\n- `correct_option` never leaks in `GET /api/quiz`\n- Correct option revealed only in attempt review; anonymous submit returns review but doesn't save\n- Users see only their own attempts; admin endpoints require admin token\n- Admin sign-in disabled when `ADMIN_PASSWORD` is unset\n- Validation messages returned for admin form\n\nBuild works (`npm run build` → `frontend/dist`), and the Dockerfile needs no changes.","time":{"start":1794302858040,"end":1794302858044}}}
